| description = [[File:Npc_gnomish_miner.png|right]]The company of Gnomes living and working in [[Solusek's Eye]] form this group. 

They are connected to the main gnomes in [[Ak'Anon]], but this faction can be enough to be able to barter and trade with them.

You can raise this faction by killing the [[Kobolds of Fire Pit]] in [[Nagafen's Lair]]. Killing the foul but relatively harmless [[Goblins of Fire Peak]] will '''not''' raise this faction.

